{"2584270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mortal Shell II", "steam_appid": 2584270, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4711720], "detailed_description": "<h1>DEVOUT EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/5b44aa4db763117130edef428b79a87a.avif?t=1788251111\" width=1024 height=1344 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.poster.avif?t=1788251111\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.webm?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.mp4?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/aa44b4940f5ec0464a73af531e88ad67.avif?t=1788251111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/aa44b4940f5ec0464a73af531e88ad67.webp?t=1788251111 width=1560 height=200 /></span>Mortal Shell II is a standalone sequel to Mortal Shell that significantly expands on the original with unrestricted, adrenaline-charged combat, extensive weapon upgrades, and free exploration. <br> <br>The forgotten Shells of eight lost warriors are scattered throughout Mortal Shell II’s ravaged world. Seek and possess these Shells, unleash their innate abilities, and discover the story of each by unravelling their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/c0e3ced798be9dbbf7d2a95e54f81966.avif?t=1788251111\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/791165393e08671874255ecbf69aff22.avif?t=1788251111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/791165393e08671874255ecbf69aff22.webp?t=1788251111 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mortal Shell II offers a clean, agile and grounded combat system, with options to think strategically about upgrading melee and ranged weapons.<br><br>Unrestricted by stamina, players exploit multiple tactics to shatter enemy posture and strike critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.poster.avif?t=1788251111\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.webm?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.mp4?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/808cfe22fa37f5597587164f84c705b4.avif?t=1788251111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/808cfe22fa37f5597587164f84c705b4.webp?t=1788251111 width=1560 height=200 /></span>Mortal Shell II’s open world is compact, tightly interconnected and immersive. It is designed with respect for the player's time. <br> <br>Those who wander from the golden path can discover new Shells, weaponry, upgrades, curiosities and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.poster.avif?t=1788251111\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.webm?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.mp4?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/aa44b4940f5ec0464a73af531e88ad67.avif?t=1788251111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/aa44b4940f5ec0464a73af531e88ad67.webp?t=1788251111 width=1560 height=200 /></span>Mortal Shell II is a standalone sequel to Mortal Shell that significantly expands on the original with unrestricted, adrenaline-charged combat, extensive weapon upgrades, and free exploration. <br> <br>The forgotten Shells of eight lost warriors are scattered throughout Mortal Shell II’s ravaged world. Seek and possess these Shells, unleash their innate abilities, and discover the story of each by unravelling their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/c0e3ced798be9dbbf7d2a95e54f81966.avif?t=1788251111\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/791165393e08671874255ecbf69aff22.avif?t=1788251111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/791165393e08671874255ecbf69aff22.webp?t=1788251111 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mortal Shell II offers a clean, agile and grounded combat system, with options to think strategically about upgrading melee and ranged weapons.<br><br>Unrestricted by stamina, players exploit multiple tactics to shatter enemy posture and strike critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.poster.avif?t=1788251111\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.webm?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.mp4?t=1788251111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" sr